{"id":"PHY-RS-SM-000014","domain":"physics","topic":"statistical_mechanics","formula":"\\begin{aligned} \\tderiv{\\kappa}{T}{P} &=& \\jac{\\kappa}{P}{T}{P}\\\\ &=& \\jac{\\kappa}{P}{T}{\\rho}\\jac{T}{\\rho}{T}{P}\\\\ &=& \\tderiv{\\rho}{P}{T}\\left[\\tderiv{\\kappa}{T}{\\rho}\\tderiv{P}{\\rho}{T}-\\tderiv{\\kappa}{\\rho}{T}\\tderiv{P}{T}{\\rho}\\right] \\\\ &=& \\tderiv{\\kappa}{T}{\\rho} - \\tderiv{\\kappa}{\\rho}{T}\\jac{\\rho}{T}{P}{T}\\jac{P}{\\rho}{T}{\\rho}\\\\ &=& \\tderiv{\\kappa}{T}{\\rho} - \\tderiv{\\kappa}{\\rho}{T} \\frac{\\chi_{T}}{\\chi_{\\rho}}\\frac{\\rho}{T} \\end{aligned}","subtopic":"A worked example: derivatives of the opacity","source_level":"research","source_ids":["MSU-STELLAR"],"relation_type":"commutation_relation","status":"model_dependent","source_locator":"https://github.com/Open-Astrophysics-Bookshelf/stellar-physics-notes/blob/afecac238cf47482e8d566bd27b3f634fca4d5cb/technical-notes/thermodynamics.tex#L76-L83","unit_system":"source_defined","conventions":["Units and sign/index conventions are retained from the cited source; no conversion was performed."]}
